[agent:result]         Create a generic Python model metadata object.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]         Note: Lazy
[agent:result]             This method is lazy and does not persist any metadata or uploads model artifacts in the
[agent:result]             model registry on its own. To save the model object and the model artifacts, call the `save()` method with a
[agent:result]             local file path to the directory containing the model artifacts.
[agent:result] 
